<view class="card result-section compact-folds"><button class="fold result-fold" data-key="showNotes" bindtap="fold"><view>缴费记录与计算详情</view><text>{{showNotes?'收起 −':'展开 ＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{showNotes}}" class="section-body">
 <block wx:if="{{paymentGuide && region.rule!=='GUANGXI_ORDINARY'}}"><button class="fold" data-key="paymentGuideOpen" bindtap="fold">补缴办法<text>{{paymentGuideOpen?'收起 −':'展开 ＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{paymentGuideOpen}}" class="detail-text"><view class="detail-group" wx:for="{{paymentGuide.rows}}" wx:key="id"><view class="option-heading">{{item.title}}</view><view>{{item.text}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.quote}}">{{item.quote}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.action}}" class="text-button" data-mode="{{item.mode}}" bindtap="guideAction">{{item.action}} ›</button></view><view class="hint">{{paymentGuide.note}}</view><button class="text-button" data-id="{{paymentGuide.sourceId}}" bindtap="policyDocument">查看缴费规定 ›</button></view></block><view wx:if="{{form.regionId==='440100'}}" class="detail-group policy-choices"><button class="fold result-fold" data-key="policyOpen" bindtap="fold"><view>补缴与提档说明</view><text>{{policyOpen?'收起 −':'展开 ＋'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{policyOpen}}" class="section-body">
 <view class="policy-item"><view class="policy-heading">以后换高档 <text class="policy-status">可以</text></view><view class="hint">按年度选档，不要求一直沿用以前360元。今年已缴的，调整从下一缴费年度开始。</view></view>
 <view class="policy-item"><view class="policy-heading">把过去低档补成高档 <text class="policy-status muted-status">暂不支持</text></view><view class="hint">过去低档补成高档的办理期已在2022年底结束。目前没查到重新开放的通知，暂时不能按补十几万来计算。</view></view>
 <view class="policy-item"><view class="policy-heading">65岁补不足的年数 <text class="policy-status">有条件</text></view><view class="hint">普通人延缴到65岁仍不足15年才可补足。这是补年数，不是把过去已交的年份提档；补缴不享政府补贴。能选哪些补缴档，请向户籍街镇确认。</view></view>
 <view class="policy-item"><view class="policy-heading">自己承担集体补助档 <text class="policy-status">有条件</text></view><view class="hint">村集体没有给予补助时，可以另选集体补助档自己交。本页只计算今后正常年缴，补缴、已交年度补差不自动加入。</view></view>
 <button class="tutorial" data-url="https://www.gzns.gov.cn/zwgk/tzgg/content/post_8719039.html" bindtap="policyDocument">历史提档什么时候截止？查看文件 ›</button>
 <button class="tutorial" data-url="https://www.gz.gov.cn/gfxwj/szfgfxwj/gzsrmzfbgt/content/post_7304595.html" bindtap="policyDocument">缴费档次和补缴条件 · 查看文件 ›</button>
</view></view>
<view class="detail-group"><view class="option-heading">已交情况</view><view>已交{{result.paidYears}}年 · 还差{{result.missing}}年</view><view wx:if="{{result.makeup}}">按这次补缴办理后，还需正常交{{result.remainingAfterMakeup}}年</view><view wx:if="{{result.pastPaid!==null}}">以前自己交了约{{result.pastPaid}}元</view></view>
 <view class="detail-group"><view class="option-heading">这份方案</view><view>退休后每月约领：{{display.monthly}}元（取整显示）</view><view>{{result.chosen.timeline.lockedYear?'以后年度年缴':'正常年缴'}}：个人{{result.chosen.annual}}元<block wx:if="{{result.chosen.socialAidAnnual}}">＋家人资助{{result.chosen.socialAidAnnual}}元</block><block wx:if="{{result.chosen.selfCollective}}">＋自费集体档{{result.chosen.selfCollective}}元</block>／年</view><view>到龄补缴：{{result.chosen.lumpYears}}年×个人{{result.chosen.lumpUnit||result.chosen.annual}}元（每年补缴单价，办理时确认）</view><view>{{display.payback.detail}}</view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{result.makeup}}" class="detail-group"><view class="option-heading">补缴／提档记录</view><view wx:for="{{result.makeup.entries}}" wx:key="year" class="schedule-item">{{item.year}}年：{{item.mode==='missing'?'补未缴':'原'+item.original+'元'}} → {{item.target}}元；另交{{item.cost}}元，补贴{{item.subsidy}}元</view></view><view class="detail-group"><view class="option-heading">逐年费用</view><view wx:for="{{result.chosen.schedule}}" wx:key="year" class="schedule-item">{{item.year}}年：{{item.cost}}元（{{item.years}}年）</view></view>
 <view class="detail-group"><view class="option-heading">怎么算的</view><view class="hint">基础养老金沿用{{result.baseYear}}年标准；利息为0，假设未来规则不变。年度缴费截止及起付月份需向户籍街镇确认。</view><view class="hint" wx:for="{{result.warnings}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view></view>
 <button wx:for="{{result.sources}}" wx:key="url" class="tutorial" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="policyDocument">{{item.name}} ›</button>
</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{showNotes}}" class="result-disclaimer">{{result.uncertainty?'按记得的情况先看大概，查到记录后再核对。':'按所选地区、尚未领取养老金的情况计算，金额供参考。'}}</view>
</block></block></block></block></block></view><tool-nav active="resident" resident-hub/>

